            "subheading": "<p>Mae Charm</p>",
            "title": "<h2>Connection & Identity</h2>",
            "description": "<p>The Mae Charm celebrates the people who make us who we are.</p><p>A symbol of connection and identity, it represents the relationships that ground us—family, friendship, love and the moments that define us. Designed to keep what matters most close to your heart, Mae is a quiet reminder that our stories are never written alone.</p>",
