            "devices": "mobile_desktop",
            "content_position": "underLeft",
            "subheading": "",
            "title": "<h2>How the Charm Builder Works</h2>",
            "description": "<p>Creating your necklace is simple.</p><p><em><strong>1. Choose Your Chain</strong></em></p><p>Begin by selecting the chain that suits your style. Whether you prefer something refined and delicate or a bolder statement, your chain becomes the foundation of your story.</p><p><em><strong>2. Add Your Charms</strong></em></p><p>Explore our collection of symbolic charms and choose the pieces that resonate with you.</p><p>Represent a loved one. Celebrate a milestone. Mark a new beginning. Or simply select the symbols you're naturally drawn to.</p><p>Each addition transforms your necklace into something uniquely yours.</p><p><em><strong>3. Personalise with Birthstones</strong></em></p><p>For selected designs, add a birthstone to represent yourself, your children, a partner, family member or someone you'll always carry close.</p><p>These thoughtful details create a piece layered with meaning—subtle enough for everyday wear, yet deeply personal to the wearer.</p><p><em><strong>4. Wear Your Story</strong></em></p><p>Once complete, your necklace becomes more than jewellery.</p><p>It becomes a reflection of your memories, your relationships and the moments that have shaped you—with the freedom to add new charms as your story continues to unfold.</p>",
            "description_mobile": "<p>Creating your necklace is simple.</p><p><em><strong>1. Choose Your Chain</strong></em></p><p>Begin by selecting the chain that suits your style. Whether you prefer something refined and delicate or a bolder statement, your chain becomes the foundation of your story.</p><p><em><strong>2. Add Your Charms</strong></em></p><p>Explore our collection of symbolic charms and choose the pieces that resonate with you.</p><p>Represent a loved one. Celebrate a milestone. Mark a new beginning. Or simply select the symbols you're naturally drawn to.</p><p>Each addition transforms your necklace into something uniquely yours.</p><p><em><strong>3. Personalise with Birthstones</strong></em></p><p>For selected designs, add a birthstone to represent yourself, your children, a partner, family member or someone you'll always carry close.</p><p>These thoughtful details create a piece layered with meaning—subtle enough for everyday wear, yet deeply personal to the wearer.</p><p><em><strong>4. Wear Your Story</strong></em></p><p>Once complete, your necklace becomes more than jewellery.</p><p>It becomes a reflection of your memories, your relationships and the moments that have shaped you—with the freedom to add new charms as your story continues to unfold.</p>",
            "colour_style": "dark",
